        "abstract": "Grid computing is defined as coordinated use of many servers and storage acting as one large computer. Oracle strategy for IT is in enterprise Grid computing and responsive in software architecture application. Policy based load balancing for database and application server clusters, dynamic allocation of servers using rules, automated routing of service requests. Self-managing database are built-in intelligent infrastructures, automatic SQL tuning, automatic storage management, automatic database diagnostic monitor.",
